# Named Tables: Edge Cases
# Valid but unusual inputs that should work correctly.

## Single row table

<!-- table: solo (val) -->
| Value |
|-------|
| 42    |

---

solo_sum = sum(solo.val)

---

## Single column table

<!-- table: ids (id) -->
| ID |
|----|
| 1  |
| 2  |
| 3  |

---

id_count = count(ids.id)

---

## Alignment colons in separator (standard GFM)

<!-- table: aligned (name, amount) -->
| Name   | Amount  |
|:-------|--------:|
| Alpha  | $100    |
| Beta   | $200    |

---

aligned_total = sum(aligned.amount)

---

## Whitespace in cells (extra padding)

<!-- table: padded (a, b) -->
|   A   |   B   |
|-------|-------|
|  10   |  20   |
|  30   |  40   |

---

padded_sum = sum(padded.a) + sum(padded.b)

---

## Directive name normalization

<!-- table: my rates (hourly, daily) -->
| Hourly | Daily |
|--------|-------|
| $50    | $400  |
| $75    | $600  |

---

my_rates_total = sum(my_rates.hourly)

---

## Element-wise with single element arrays

<!-- table: one (x, y) -->
| X | Y |
|---|---|
| 5 | 3 |

---

product = one.x * one.y
